==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Safari Zone" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Scyther|5}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Sharp Scythe''' attack, which first appeared as '''Sharp Sickle''' on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Kabutops|9}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion.<ref group="nb">Kabutops uses hiragana (するどいかま) for the Japanese attack name, while all subsequent instances use katakana (するどいカマ) instead.</ref>
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

